     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Facts, request and tone",
     "texto": [
      "An effective complaint keeps a professional tone, gives dates and references, describes the problem and explains what response you want. **Jeg har betalt fakturaen, men varen er ikke levert** («I've paid the invoice, but the goods haven't been delivered») combines the perfect and contrast; **Jeg ville sette pris på en tilbakemelding** («I would appreciate some feedback») softens the request."
     ],
